  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development must be carried out within a period of five years from the date on which the local planning authority were given the information referred to in paragraph b(ii) of Schedule 2, Part 11, Class B of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (i.e. a written description of the proposed development, a statement that a notice has been posted in accordance with paragraph (b)(iv) and any fee required to be paid).\r\nReason: In accordance with the conditions of Schedule 2, Part 11, Class B of the Town and Country (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development shall be carried out strictly in accordance with the following plans and documents submitted with the application: Cover letter dated 06 February 2026 by Stantec (Ref. 333100643/A5); Bat Survey Report dated December 2025; Demolition Environmental Management Plan, Construction Activity, Traffic and Dust Management Plan (Revision 1) dated 5 January 2026; Pre-demolition audit report (Ref. 16149) dated 30 July 2025; Preliminary Ecological Appraisal dated December 2025 (Ref. 250315-ED-01a).\r\nReason: In accordance with the conditions of Schedule 2, Part 11, Class B of the Town and Country (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n"
  ],
